      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "SDK 3.10.3, have the same problem\n\nEdit: In this Feedback post https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/serialized-field-of-type-runtimeanimatorcontroller-throws-exception-in-game was a comment about using AnimatorOverrideController  instead and that worked for me as well",
